Homepage: https://github.com/carbon6-dev/carbon6
Description: carbon6 worker
 Runs carbon6 agent sessions on this machine for a carbon6 head. Runs as a
 user: from boot with the c6w@<user> systemd service, or in that user's
 systemd session with `systemctl --user enable --now c6w`.
